{%- comment -%}
  Mini product page rendered inside the cart drawer rather than as a second
  modal. Product, media and variant controls are filled by cart-extras.js.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="cart-miniview" data-cart-miniview role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="{{ 'cart.mini.product_details_aria' | t }}" aria-hidden="true" hidden>
  <div class="cart-miniview__head">
    <p class="lbl">{{ 'quick_view.head_label' | t }}</p>
    <button type="button" class="hdr__icon" data-cart-miniview-close aria-label="{{ 'cart.mini.close' | t }}">
      {% render 'icon', name: 'close', size: 20 %}
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="cart-miniview__body">
    <div class="cart-miniview__media"><img data-cart-mv-img src="" alt="" width="600" height="800"></div>
    <div class="cart-miniview__buy">
      {%- comment -%} SAME TYPE AS THE QUICK VIEW AND THE PDP: .dm is the serif
      display face at up to 34px — in a 430px drawer that headline alone pushed
      the size picker and the buy button below the fold. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- comment -%} THE PDP'S OWN ORDER AND ITS OWN COMPONENTS: the rating
      used the cart's `.cart-rating`, which is centre-aligned for the drawer
      footer — under a left-aligned price it looked misplaced rather than
      styled. It is now the same snippet the product page renders, above the
      title, where it belongs. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- render 'pdp-rating' -%}
      <h3 class="pdp__name lbl" data-cart-mv-title></h3>
      <div class="cart-miniview__price pdp__price lbl" data-cart-mv-price></div>
      <div class="cart-miniview__options" data-cart-mv-options></div>
      {%- comment -%} No scarcity line: the cart-extras.js painter that filled this
      slot generated the state from product.id, so the placeholder went with it. See
      snippets/pdp-scarcity.liquid. {%- endcomment -%}
      <button type="button" class="bar cart-miniview__atc" data-cart-mv-atc disabled>
        <span data-cart-mv-atc-label>{{ 'product.atc.add_to_bag' | t }}</span>
      </button>
      {%- if settings.ship_free_line != blank or settings.trust_returns_line != blank or settings.trust_customers_line != blank -%}
        <div class="cart-miniview__trust lbl-sm">
          {%- if settings.ship_free_line != blank -%}<span>{{ settings.ship_free_line | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.trust_returns_line != blank -%}<span>{{ settings.trust_returns_line | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          {%- comment %} disabled: unverified social proof — enable once backed by real customer counts {% endcomment -%}
          {%- if false and settings.trust_customers_line != blank -%}<span>{{ settings.trust_customers_line | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      <a class="tlink" data-cart-mv-link href="#">{{ 'quick_view.view_all_details' | t }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
